{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable to all, only mastered by a few, with a unique combo system and rich build crafting for a roguelite. Challenge your perfected builds against ascending difficulties with increased rewards and exclusive encounters, cards, items, and more! Prepare to embark on a perilous journey through the realm to find the source of the impending doom spreading across the lands. Become the <strong>Harbinger of Destiny</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through numerous Regions to defeat the wardens of the void standing in your way, discover mysterious events, and battle your way through many enemies towards finding the cause of the ever-encroaching void.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the combo system to evolve your playstyle and play more cards during your turn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play multiple attacks in a row to make the next one have no cost to be played!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an enhancement alongside an attack to increase the damage of your next attack!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play two augment cards in a row to recover your resources and create more combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your favorite cards by reforging them into more powerful versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/cf2bd260294852972c3e04e1abbe47c2.avif?t=1770987831\" width=984 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear the void calling out to you? Roll the dice of fate and channel the void into your cards, altering them in unpredictable ways, whether that be reducing their cost or increasing their damage, even adding new effects! Of course, the card could be lost or reduced in value, such is the way of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up as you progress, and experience an ever-expanding tree with over 50 nodes of powerful bonuses and notable passives that will surely alter your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835870?t=1770987831","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3835870?t=1770987831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/f4d2342570c54290d81ff92e6c0357143c014909/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770987831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/f4d2342570c54290d81ff92e6c0357143c014909/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770987831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There is frequent violence and depictions of death. There are no sexual themes and minor references to alcohol consumption."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable to all, only mastered by a few, with a unique combo system and rich build crafting for a roguelite. Challenge your perfected builds against ascending difficulties with increased rewards and exclusive encounters, cards, items, and more! Prepare to embark on a perilous journey through the realm to find the source of the impending doom spreading across the lands. Become the <strong>Harbinger of Destiny</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through numerous Regions to defeat the wardens of the void standing in your way, discover mysterious events, and battle your way through many enemies towards finding the cause of the ever-encroaching void.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/1ba89ee7f6c7c315772d4a3c6c0f7b12.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the combo system to evolve your playstyle and play more cards during your turn.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play multiple attacks in a row to make the next one have no cost to be played!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an enhancement alongside an attack to increase the damage of your next attack!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play two augment cards in a row to recover your resources and create more combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/8e57ac87bd9819f8927952a6bc529403.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your favorite cards by reforging them into more powerful versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/cf2bd260294852972c3e04e1abbe47c2.avif?t=1770987831\" width=984 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear the void calling out to you? Roll the dice of fate and channel the void into your cards, altering them in unpredictable ways, whether that be reducing their cost or increasing their damage, even adding new effects! Of course, the card could be lost or reduced in value, such is the way of the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rank up as you progress, and experience an ever-expanding tree with over 50 nodes of powerful bonuses and notable passives that will surely alter your runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.poster.avif?t=1770987831\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.webm?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/extras/6ab484cd0b82a36c3e0f2cd0f3d4fb75.mp4?t=1770987831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Astral Productions LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3835870/50d73fd06a94dafd0424be1eee3434e853f5df21/header.jpg?t=1770987831","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3835870/2087847430/af7aba7daefcef6bacb87b90a74981012db0fc7e/1752107381/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758128646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3835870/2087847430/af7aba7daefcef6bacb87b90a74981012db0fc7e/1752107381/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758128646","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store